{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3606780/extras/285102675af5c3a98f084922350eed56.gif?t=1771271371\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3606780/extras/285102675af5c3a98f084922350eed56.poster.avif?t=1771271371\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">A new short horror adventure from the world of <strong><i>The Bunny Graveyard</i></strong>, for new and returning players alike!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >STORY MODE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3606780/extras/142615bcbd9d8cba44d4eb5ac7b9477a.poster.avif?t=1771271371\" width=800 height=268 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3606780/extras/142615bcbd9d8cba44d4eb5ac7b9477a.webm?t=1771271371\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3606780/extras/142615bcbd9d8cba44d4eb5ac7b9477a.mp4?t=1771271371\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >By day, you run a small gas station in <strong>Carrot Town</strong>, serving its quirky citizens, meeting their strange demands, and keeping your promise. By night, the power goes out, and a terrifying monster lurks in the shadows. Check the vents, peek through the windows, and stay on guard... all while sneaking in a round of <strong><i>Chunky JUMP!</i></strong> on your trusty <strong>BIRD BOY</strong> console.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >ENDLESS MODE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3606780/extras/c55d37eff4a8ba172b5e2ff335ec7395.poster.avif?t=1771271371\" width=800 height=268 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3606780/extras/c55d37eff4a8ba172b5e2ff335ec7395.webm?t=1771271371\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3606780/extras/c55d37eff4a8ba172b5e2ff335ec7395.mp4?t=1771271371\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A <strong>roguelike-inspired mode</strong>\u00a0where you play through randomized levels, nights, and minigames. Push your run as far as possible, earn miles or <strong><i>DIAL-A-RIVAL</i></strong> and unlock crossover rivals from other indie worlds (such as <strong><i>The Bunny Graveyard, Garten of Banban, Indigo Park</i></strong> and more). But be careful, if you lose, you'll have to start over!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEATURES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3606780/extras/93e490e7b0a9c71b9946de4e3de1cc76.poster.avif?t=1771271371\" width=800 height=268 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3606780/extras/93e490e7b0a9c71b9946de4e3de1cc76.webm?t=1771271371\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3606780/extras/93e490e7b0a9c71b9946de4e3de1cc76.mp4?t=1771271371\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fully animated <strong>CUTSCENES</strong>!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock <strong>ACHIEVEMENTS</strong> and test your skills.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>COLLECT</strong> skins for Chunky and meet some new and familiar faces...</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>CUSTOMIZE</strong> your BIRD BOY 